sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant OS as Order Service
    participant PGO as PostgreSQL (order_service)
    MQ->>OS: 8 concurrent copies of StockReserved (same MessageId)
    OS->>PGO: one transaction each: Confirmed + Inbox row
    PGO-->>OS: one commits, the others hit the Inbox unique index
    OS-->>MQ: all acked (applied once, others no-op)
    MQ->>OS: OrderProcessed while the order is still PendingStock
    OS->>MQ: requeue to a delayed retry queue (2, 4, 8 s), ack the original
    MQ->>OS: StockReserved arrives: PendingStock -> Confirmed
    MQ->>OS: OrderProcessed again after its delay
    OS->>PGO: Confirmed -> Completed once (implied Processing row)
